## Type mapping

| Arrow physical type | API wire type | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| `FixedSizeBinary(16)` | `String` (lowercase hex) | trace_id |
| `FixedSizeBinary(8)` | `String` (lowercase hex) | span_id |
| `Timestamp(µs, UTC)` | `DateTime<Utc>` (RFC3339) | All timestamps |
| `Utf8` | `String` | |
| `Variant` | JSON value | The `arrow.parquet.variant` extension over a `metadata`/`value` binary Struct; typed row terminals decode it to the language's native open value |
| `List<T>`, `Struct` | Array, object | Nested typed collections |
| `Int64` nullable | `Option<i64>` | Token counts, counts, and other unsigned OTLP values |
| `Float64` nullable | `Option<f64>` | Scores, values |
